ive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-158685-e-3\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-158685-e-3\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is 'I and III only.'</p>\n</div></div>",
